ory</a><a href=\"{{p:visit}}\">Find us</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></div><div><h4>Utility</h4><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"{{p:404}}\">404 error</a></div></div></li></ul><a class=\"cb-btn\" href=\"{{p:order}}\">Order ahead</a><details class=\"cb-mobile-nav\"><summary>Menu</summary><nav aria-label=\"Café navigation\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><a href=\"{{p:menu}}\">Food &amp; coffee</a><a href=\"{{p:bakes}}\">Today’s bakes</a><a href=\"{{p:order}}\">Order ahead</a><a href=\"{{p:catering}}\">Catering</a><a href=\"{{p:story}}\">Our story</a><a href=\"{{p:visit}}\">Find us</a><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">FAQ</a></nav></details></div></header>\n","foot":"<footer class=\"cb-foot\">\n  <div class=\"cb-footer-inner\">\n    <div class=\"cb-footer-grid\">\n      <div class=\"cb-footer-brand\">\n        <a class=\"cb-footer-logo\" href=\"{{p:home}}\" aria-label=\"Crumb and Co, home\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">C</span>Crumb &amp; Co</a>\n        <p class=\"cb-footer-message\">A good morning.<br>A little slower.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-footer-description\">Sourdough, buttery croissants<br>and a proper cup of coffee.</p>\n        <p class=\"cb-footer-address\">12 Jalan Telawi, Bangsar<br>Sample café location</p>\n      </div>\n      <nav class=\"cb-footer-nav\" aria-label=\"Café links\">\n        <h2>At the café</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"{{p:menu}}\">Food &amp; coffee</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"{{p:bakes}}\">Today’s bakes</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"{{p:order}}\">Order ahead</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"{{p:catering}}\">Catering</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n      <nav class=\"cb-footer-nav\" aria-label=\"Visit links\">\n        <h2>Come say hello</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"{{p:story}}\">Our story</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"{{p:visit}}\">Find us</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"{{p:faq}}\">Questions &amp; answers</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cb-footer-bottom\"><p>© 2026 Crumb &amp; Co. <span>Template demo.</span></p><a href=\"{{p:privacy}}\">Privacy policy</a></div>\n    <details class=\"cb-credits\"><summary>Illustrative photography &amp; credits</summary><p>Stock images illustrate the layout, not the actual café, staff or exact products. Photos remain hosted remotely and need an internet connection. Replace with your own photography for a real business.</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/latte-croissant-and-book-on-cafe-table-1k7TnX5GAww\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rizky Subagja</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-stack-of-four-pieces-of-bread-sitting-on-top-of-a-table-U9-0JVdjCVo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Caramel</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-close-up-of-a-croissant-on-a-white-surface-VgsizSk7py0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Olga Petnyunene</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/croissants-on-display-TG77ANwm3MQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mimi Thian</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/cup-of-cappuccino-2y4tsj5iouQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Joe Hepburn</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bakery-and-coffee-shops-interior-is-shown-iTD5w0VxnpQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Firda Faradiba</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/baker-scoring-dough-with-a-razor-blade-t51-WQwU2z4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Diego Arenas de Rodrigo</a></li><li><a href=\"https://unsplash.com/photos/a-decadent-chocolate-cake-with-slices-on-plates-cAy6uai7l5U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Just Capturing It</a></li></ul><p>Free collection photographs used under the <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unsplash License</a>. No original photo files are included in downloads.</p></details>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n","pages":{"home":"<section class=\"cb-hero cb-photo-hero\"><div class=\"cb-hero-copy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Bangsar · Your morning, made slowly</span><h1>Bread worth <em>waking up</em> for.</h1><p>Slow-fermented sourdough, buttery croissants and a very good reason to take your time.</p><div class=\"cb-actions\"><a class=\"cb-btn\" href=\"{{p:order}}\">Order ahead</a><a class=\"cb-btn o\" href=\"{{p:menu}}\">See the menu</a></div><div class=\"cb-hero-note\"><span>01 / Freshly baked</span><p>A little flour. A little patience.<br>Something good, every morning.</p></div></div><div class=\"cb-hero-visual\"><figure class=\"cb-photo cb-hero-image\"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Coffee and croissant on a sunlit wooden café table · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542372147193-a7aca54189cd?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1920&amp;h=2400&amp;q=82\" width=\"1920\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Coffee and croissant on a sunlit wooden café table\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><span class=\"cb-photo-stamp\">Baked early.<br>Gone by noon.</span><div class=\"cb-board cb-hero-board\"><h3>Today at the counter</h3><ul><li><span>Country sourdough</span><b>RM 16</b></li><li><span>Butter croissant</span><b>RM 7.5</b></li><li><span>Flat white</span><b>RM 11</b></li></ul><a href=\"{{p:bakes}}\">See today’s bakes →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"cb-sec\" style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--c-accent) 10%,var(--c-surface))\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"cb-ttl\"><small>The counter</small><h2>Our best-loved</h2></div><div class=\"cb-tags\"><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Slices of artisan sourdough showing the open crumb · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677825948767-5d379d012bda?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Slices of artisan sourdough showing the open crumb\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Sourdough</h3><p>48-hour ferment, blistered crust</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 16</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Golden butter croissant with crisp pastry layers · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1709798289100-7b46217e0325?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Golden butter croissant with crisp pastry layers\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Croissant</h3><p>27 layers, French butter</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 7.5</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548538931-b47653628cdc?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Morning pastries</h3><p>A fresh selection from the counter</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 6</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">A cup of flat white coffee beside green foliage · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577968897441-c1e88d1bda20?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"A cup of flat white coffee beside green foliage\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Flat white</h3><p>Single-origin Sabah beans</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 11</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"cb-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"cb-ttl\"><small>Morning to afternoon</small><h2>Breakfast, brunch, a slice of cake</h2></div><div class=\"cb-menu\"><div class=\"cb-it\"><b>Egg &amp; toast</b><i></i><span>RM 18</span><p>Free-range eggs, sourdough, kimchi butter</p></div><div class=\"cb-it\"><b>Smoked salmon bagel</b><i></i><span>RM 26</span><p>Cream cheese, capers, pickled onion</p></div><div class=\"cb-it\"><b>Banana bread</b><i></i><span>RM 9</span><p>Warm, with salted caramel</p></div><div class=\"cb-it\"><b>Iced pandan latte</b><i></i><span>RM 13</span><p>Coconut cream, gula melaka</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"cb-sec\"><div class=\"in cb-story-row\"><figure class=\"cb-photo cb-story-image\"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">A baker's hands carefully scoring dough before baking · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767065886923-4784897b653f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"A baker's hands carefully scoring dough before baking\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><div class=\"cb-story-copy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A slower kind of good</span><h2>More time.<br>Better bread.</h2><p>Good bread begins long before the doors open. Flour, water and a little patience — that’s the rhythm we like.</p><a class=\"cb-text-link\" href=\"{{p:story}}\">A little about us ↗</a><small>Illustrative craft photography.</small></div></div></section><section class=\"cb-photo-cta\"><figure class=\"cb-photo cb-cta-background\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548538931-b47653628cdc?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2400&amp;h=1600&amp;q=82\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1600\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><div class=\"cb-cta-paper\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Your morning, on your time</span><h2>Good things.<br>No queue.</h2><p>Choose your favourites and explore a pick-up request.</p><a class=\"cb-btn\" href=\"{{p:order}}\">Plan your pick-up ↗</a></div></section>\n","menu":"<section class=\"pagehead\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Menu</b></div><h1>Menu</h1></div></section><section class=\"cb-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"cb-photo-pair\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Coffee and croissant on a sunlit wooden café table · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542372147193-a7aca54189cd?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Coffee and croissant on a sunlit wooden café table\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">A cup of flat white coffee beside green foliage · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577968897441-c1e88d1bda20?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"A cup of flat white coffee beside green foliage\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure></div><div class=\"cb-menu\"><div class=\"cb-it\"><b>Espresso</b><i></i><span>RM 8</span><p>Double shot</p></div><div cl