n=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Butter croissant</h3><p>Out at 6:30am</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 7.5</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548538931-b47653628cdc?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Morning pastries</h3><p>Out at 8am</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 8</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Slices of artisan sourdough showing the open crumb · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677825948767-5d379d012bda?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Slices of artisan sourdough showing the open crumb\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Sourdough slices</h3><p>Out at 7am</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 9</span></div></div></div></section>\n","order":"<section class=\"pagehead\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Order ahead</b></div><h1>Your morning, ready to go.</h1></div></section><section class=\"cb-sec\"><div class=\"in cb-order-layout\"><div><figure class=\"cb-photo cb-wide-photo\"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548538931-b47653628cdc?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2160&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"2160\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h2>A little planning.<br>A very good morning.</h2><p>Choose your favourites and a sample pick-up slot.</p><p class=\"cb-demo-note\">Interactive demo only. No order is sent, no payment is collected and no pick-up is reserved.</p></div><form class=\"cb-order-demo\"><label class=\"fld\"><span>Your name</span><input name=\"customer\" autocomplete=\"name\" required maxlength=\"100\"></label><label class=\"fld\"><span>Phone</span><input name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" autocomplete=\"tel\" required maxlength=\"40\"></label><label class=\"fld\"><span>What would you like?</span><textarea name=\"items\" rows=\"4\" required maxlength=\"1000\" placeholder=\"2 croissants, 1 country sourdough\"></textarea></label><fieldset><legend>Sample pick-up time</legend><div class=\"cb-slot\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"slot\" value=\"7:30\" checked><span>7:30</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"slot\" value=\"8:30\"><span>8:30</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"slot\" value=\"10:00\"><span>10:00</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"slot\" value=\"12:30\"><span>12:30</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"slot\" value=\"15:00\"><span>15:00</span></label></div></fieldset><button class=\"cb-btn\" type=\"submit\">Preview pick-up request</button><output role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output></form></div></section><script>(function(){var f=document.querySelector('.cb-order-demo');if(!f)return;f.addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();if(!f.reportValidity())return;f.querySelector('output').textContent='Demo request prepared for '+f.elements.customer.value.trim()+' at '+f.elements.slot.value+'. Nothing has been sent or reserved.'})})();</script>\n","catering":"<section class=\"pagehead\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Catering</b></div><h1>Catering</h1></div></section><section class=\"cb-sec\"><div class=\"in\"><p class=\"cb-demo-note\">Package photographs are illustrative serving ideas. Replace them with your own menu photography before launch.</p><div class=\"cb-tags\"><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Coffee and croissant on a sunlit wooden café table · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542372147193-a7aca54189cd?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Coffee and croissant on a sunlit wooden café table\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Breakfast box</h3><p>Pastries, fruit, coffee for 10</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 180</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548538931-b47653628cdc?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Fresh croissants arranged at a bakery counter\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Meeting platter</h3><p>Sandwiches &amp; sweets for 15</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 260</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Slices of artisan sourdough showing the open crumb · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1677825948767-5d379d012bda?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Slices of artisan sourdough showing the open crumb\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Bread subscription</h3><p>Weekly loaves for offices</p><span class=\"pr\">RM 64/wk</span></div><div class=\"cb-tag\"><figure class=\"cb-photo \"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Chocolate cake and plated slices for a shared table · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767044315790-bc0fe664fd0b?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1440&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Chocolate cake and plated slices for a shared table\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><h3>Custom cake</h3><p>Order 3 days ahead</p><span class=\"pr\">from RM 120</span></div></div></div></section>\n","story":"<section class=\"pagehead\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Our story</b></div><h1>Our story</h1></div></section><section class=\"cb-sec\"><div class=\"in split\"><figure class=\"cb-photo cb-story-image\"><span class=\"cb-photo-fallback\" aria-hidden=\"true\">A baker's hands carefully scoring dough before baking · photo unavailable</span><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767065886923-4784897b653f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1440&amp;h=1080&amp;q=82\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"A baker's hands carefully scoring dough before baking\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onerror=\"this.hidden=true;this.previousElementSibling.removeAttribute('aria-hidden')\"></figure><div class=\"prose\"><p class=\"lead\">Two friends, one oven, and a starter named Gerald.</p><p>This is a sample café story: a small neighbourhood bakehouse, slow mornings and bread made with patience. Replace it with your own people, process and photographs.</p></div></div></section>\n","visit":"<section class=\"pagehead\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</